exists subj name outside obj num 0 be number ya
exists subj name switches obj ve bool truth lie truth be vector ya

subj name flip index to name num bucket fromindex num 0 be ceremony def
obj name switches at num of fromindex of this be invert do
subj name flip index be ceremony prah

# Loop fromindex counts up and stops when it reaches toindex; this hits indices 0,1,2.
to name outside fromindex num 0 toindex num 3 be flip index do

obj name outside be write do
obj name switches be write do
